<title>FINLAND: TABLE-RAUMA H1 PROFIT FALLS 6.7 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE-RAUMA H1 PROFIT FALLS 6.7 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June, 1997</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     318 vs 341</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   4.24 vs 4.57</p>
<p> Net sales					  4,906 vs 4,938</p>
<p> Operating profit				   338 vs 357</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast for Finnish engineering group Rauma Oy's first-half profit before extraordinary items and tax had been 318 million markka (range 234-366 million).  </p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (pct)		  39.7 vs 44.0 end-96</p>
<p> Return on equity (ROE) (pct)		  16.8 vs 19.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish engineering group is Rauma Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
